  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, excellent timing! I can tell you’re a Trainer—\nand a talented one at that!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve got a knack for battling, ourselves.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEspecially since we switched up our battle tactics.\nWe’ve been on a crazy winning streak!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s the secret to our success, you ask?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhy, status moves, of course!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Status moves boost your Pokémon’s strength!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400610074007500730020006D006F00760065007300200062006F006F0073007400200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E2019007300200073007400720065006E006700740068002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And they can weaken your opponents, too!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200074006800650079002000630061006E0020007700650061006B0065006E00200079006F007500720020006F00700070006F006E0065006E00740073002C00200074006F006F002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Expert battlers like us know better than to just\ndish out damage nonstop!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ll see what we mean soon enough!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00752019006C006C0020007300650065002000770068006100740020007700650020006D00650061006E00200073006F006F006E00200065006E006F007500670068002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’re fool—I mean—brave enough to take on\nour status moves, we’ll gladly battle you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me know when you’re ready.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F00770020007700680065006E00200079006F0075201900720065002000720065006100640079002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you all limbered up and ready to run—er, I\nmean—battle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F007500200061006C006C0020006C0069006D0062006500720065006400200075007000200061006E006400200072006500610064007900200074006F002000720075006E201400650072002C00200049000A006D00650061006E20140062006100740074006C0065003F00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s go, go, go!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200067006F002C00200067006F002C00200067006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I need to prep",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006E00650065006400200074006F002000700072006500700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No worries—us status move masters know how\nto pace ourselves. We’ll wait for the right time.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon specialize in status moves that\nboost their stats!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007300700065006300690061006C0069007A006500200069006E00200073007400610074007500730020006D006F00760065007300200074006800610074000A0062006F006F00730074002000740068006500690072002000730074006100740073002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The longer our battle lasts, the more we’ll drive\nyour team into a corner!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The two of us are on a roll! Be a dear and help us\nset an even higher record for our winning streak!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Argh! You totally wrecked our winning streak!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007200670068002100200059006F007500200074006F00740061006C006C007900200077007200650063006B006500640020006F00750072002000770069006E006E0069006E0067002000730074007200650061006B002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on—we’re not out of the game yet! If I win,\nthat means our streak is still unbroken!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s my turn now. I won’t let you put an end to our\nperfect string of victories!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If I beat you, our winning streak can keep going!\nAre you ready to begin?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s go, go, go!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200067006F002C00200067006F002C00200067006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I need to prep",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006E00650065006400200074006F002000700072006500700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Really? Or are you nervous about having your\nPokémon weakened by mine?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon specialize in status moves that lower\nthe opponent’s stats!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s right—get ready to watch your Pokémon’s\nusual power go flying out the window!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our streak isn’t over until we’re both down. It\ndoesn’t count if you beat only one of us!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I...I can’t believe our status moves weren’t\nenough to beat you...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002E002E002E0049002000630061006E20190074002000620065006C00690065007600650020006F0075007200200073007400610074007500730020006D006F00760065007300200077006500720065006E20190074000A0065006E006F00750067006800200074006F0020006200650061007400200079006F0075002E002E002E00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon powered themselves up and\neverything...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200070006F007700650072006500640020007400680065006D00730065006C00760065007300200075007000200061006E0064000A00650076006500720079007400680069006E0067002E002E002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And my Pokémon powered yours down...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200070006F0077006500720065006400200079006F00750072007300200064006F0077006E002E002E002E00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why wasn’t that enough to win?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800790020007700610073006E201900740020007400680061007400200065006E006F00750067006800200074006F002000770069006E003F002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Could you give us some advice? What should we\ndo to be better Trainers?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Believe in your Pokémon",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420065006C006900650076006500200069006E00200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Train your Pokémon well",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007200610069006E00200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000770065006C006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmph. Well said!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D00700068002E002000570065006C006C00200073006100690064002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Raising and lowering stats are valid strategies, but\nthey’re not surefire ways to win, I suppose.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for the valuable lesson. There’s so much\nwe still have to learn about Pokémon battles.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Agreed! Thank you so much, mystery Trainer. I’m\nso glad we could battle you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for the valuable lesson. There’s so much\nwe still have to learn about Pokémon battles.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much, mystery Trainer. I’m so glad\nwe could battle you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5488,
